data
  title CQRS and event sourcing are independent: four combinations
  desc Splitting reads from writes (CQRS) and storing state as an event log (ES) are orthogonal; conflating them needlessly doubles the cost.
  compares
    - label No CQRS + no ES: plain CRUD
    - label CQRS + no ES: projected reads
    - label No CQRS + ES: read by replay
    - label CQRS + ES: pay for both
